RedBeat Player v5.0
A red & black themed offline music player for Android and iOS.

Features:
- 5-Band Parametric Equalizer (60Hz, 230Hz, 910Hz, 3.6kHz, 14kHz)
- Bass Boost & 3D Virtualizer
- Direct URL Music Downloader (MP3, M4A, M3U/M3U8)
- Local File & Folder Import
- Wi-Fi Music Transfer
- Smart Playlist Manager
- Lock Screen & Headphone Controls
- Purple Moon Mascot App Icon

Designed with love by @LM7BOS
